# The operations of the pinned schema (openapi.v1.json) that this crate's own document (openapi.thrust.json) describes: all 32 of the scope `m1` (exceptions.yaml), the end of issue #58's steps by resource.
# `scripts/check-openapi.sh` cuts the pin to exactly these, diffs the two with oasdiff, and fails if the document has more or fewer.
# An operation outside the scope is added when its bodies are types, and not before.
#
# Projects (8 of 8)
list_projects
create_project
list_projects_lite
retrieve_project
update_project
delete_project
archive_project
unarchive_project
#
# States (5 of 5)
list_states
create_state
retrieve_state
update_state
delete_state
#
# Labels (5 of 5; the pin names the detail read `get_labels`)
list_labels
create_label
get_labels
update_label
delete_label
#
# Work Items (14 of 14: seven operations under `issues/` and the same seven under `work-items/`, whose ids end in `_2`)
list_work_items
create_work_item
retrieve_work_item
update_work_item
delete_work_item
get_workspace_work_item
search_work_items
list_work_items_2
create_work_item_2
retrieve_work_item_2
update_work_item_2
delete_work_item_2
get_workspace_work_item_2
search_work_items_2
